{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01C3VNqiJwJMb4GEBE4rAgU1","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Line pricing rules\n2\t\n3\tprice(p) computes the final price string for p = {\"qty\": int,\n4\t\"unit_price\": str, \"discount_pct\": int, \"tax_pct\": int}.\n5\t\n6\t1. subtotal = qty x unit_price, rounded to the cent, half away from zero.\n7\t2. discounted = subtotal reduced by discount_pct percent, rounded to the\n8\t   cent, half away from zero.\n9\t3. final = discounted increased by tax_pct percent, rounded to the cent,\n10\t   half away from zero.\n11\t4. The result is the final amount as a string with exactly two decimals.\n12\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"43cab0ad-b8de-423d-be51-04810b037fe6","uuid":"166098ab-1cc5-4b7e-880f-6b3428f2afcb","timestamp":"2026-08-09T17:15:55.341Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-creator-0/113f7cc5-237e-5d6a-8867-a97fd89c58dd/scratchpad/e6/e6-t19/primary/exec-ws/package/artifacts/pricing.md","content":"# Line pricing rules\n\nprice(p) computes the final price string for p = {\"qty\": int,\n\"unit_price\": str, \"discount_pct\": int, \"tax_pct\": int}.\n\n1. subtotal = qty x unit_price, rounded to the cent, half away from zero.\n2. discounted = subtotal reduced by discount_pct percent, rounded to the\n   cent, half away from zero.\n3. final = discounted increased by tax_pct percent, rounded to the cent,\n   half away from zero.\n4. The result is the final amount as a string with exactly two decimals.\n","numLines":12,"startLine":1,"totalLines":12}}}
