{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdsZDWTyNxDupC9aT5oXv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01WxBb4wFMNUTBjN6rRQBR8K","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-creator-0/113f7cc5-237e-5d6a-8867-a97fd89c58dd/scratchpad/e6/e6-t19/primary/exec-ws/child/integration-plan.json","content":"{\n  \"role\": \"clean_room_implementer\",\n  \"child_deliverable\": \"result.json\",\n  \"child_implementation_file\": \"impl.py\",\n  \"rule\": \"Deterministic, judgment-free integration. (1) Import price as child_price from the child's impl.py, and import price as ref_price from package/artifacts/price.py. (2) Load probes from package/artifacts/probes.json as an ordered list. (3) For each index i and probe in that list, compute a_i = child_price(probe) and b_i = ref_price(probe); also cross-check a_i equals the child's result.json outputs[i] and reject on mismatch (impl/outputs inconsistency). (4) divergent_probe_indices = sorted list of every i where str(a_i) != str(b_i). (5) verdict = 'DIVERGES' if divergent_probe_indices is non-empty else 'REPRODUCES'. (6) Set result.json.divergent_probe_indices = divergent_probe_indices and result.json.verdict = verdict; leave undetermined_behaviors as the E-A statement carried from evidence record ev-A (unchanged by integration). This maps Q1 (E-B, the mechanical item-level comparison) and, together with the already-admissible E-A statement, Q3 (E-C, the final verdict) to their resolved values.\",\n  \"child_implementation_file_path\": \"child_workspace/impl.py\",\n  \"reference_implementation_path\": \"package/artifacts/price.py\",\n  \"probes_path\": \"package/artifacts/probes.json\",\n  \"expected_contribution\": {\n    \"Q1\": \"Supplies the blind-authored implementation exposing price(p) plus its per-probe outputs, enabling the mechanically reproducible item-level comparison against price.py over probes.json.\",\n    \"Q3\": \"Combined with the admissible E-A statement, the integrated comparison yields the final verdict (DIVERGES iff some probe differs) and the sorted divergent_probe_indices.\"\n  }\n}\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":660,"cache_read_input_tokens":52516,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":660},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"43cab0ad-b8de-423d-be51-04810b037fe6","uuid":"e5244fc2-48b6-4db7-adf1-244e73fce263","timestamp":"2026-08-09T17:18:50.804Z","request_id":"req_011CdsZDTHyjA8VybqvAF2e2"}
