admissible from a party that has read both pricing.md and price.py; it imposes no authorship or blind-access condition.\",\n    \"refs\": [\n      \"package/artifacts/pricing.md\",\n      \"package/artifacts/price.py\",\n      \"package/artifacts/probes.json\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"ev-B-charge\",\n    \"source_node\": \"propose-child\",\n    \"description\": \"E-B is assigned to a fresh isolated child because its admissibility requires an implementation authored solely from pricing.md by an author who has never accessed price.py nor any analysis derived from it. This session has read price.py and performed E-A, so it is contaminated and cannot author admissible E-B evidence. The child bundle under child/ (contract, harness, prompt, input-manifest, integration-plan) charges a terminal worker to author impl.py exposing price(p) from pricing.md alone and to emit its per-probe outputs over probes.json; the child's input manifest excludes price.py and all session analysis so the blind-authorship condition holds. The mechanically reproducible item-level comparison against price.py is performed deterministically at root-executed verify-integration per child/integration-plan.json.\",\n    \"refs\": [\n      \"child/child-contract.json\",\n      \"child/child-harness.json\",\n      \"child/child-prompt.md\",\n      \"child/child-input-manifest.json\",\n      \"child/integration-plan.json\"\n    ]\n  }\n]\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":914,"cache_read_input_tokens":53176,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":914},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"43cab0ad-b8de-423d-be51-04810b037fe6","uuid":"3007359d-6a98-4487-91bc-09009a3679a2","timestamp":"2026-08-09T17:19:08.148Z","request_id":"req_